{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "59703d86-1ce5-4718-9ecd-c56670493bd8",
    "name": "DIGIT AccessControl v3",
    "description": "Production collection for the AccessControl service (v3).\n\n## Endpoints\n- **RBAC** — CRUD + bulk + delete-by-tenant under `/v3/rbac/rules`.\n- **JBAC** — same shape under `/v3/jbac/rules`.\n- **Internal** — `/v3/internal/{rbac,jbac}/rules[/version]` (Kong plugin consumers — no tenant header).\n- **Operational** — `/health`.\n\n## Variables\n| Variable | Default | Notes |\n|---|---|---|\n| `baseUrl` | `http://localhost:8080/access/v3` | LTS: `https://digit-lts.digit.org/access/v3` |\n| `tenantId` | `pg` | Sent as X-Tenant-ID on tenant-scoped routes. |\n| `userId` | `00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001` | Sent as X-User-ID on writes. |\n| `accessToken` | — | Keycloak bearer (Kong-validated). |\n| `rbacRuleId`, `jbacRuleId` | (auto) | Captured from the respective create-rule response. |\n\n## Error envelope\nAll non-2xx responses are `[]Error` arrays with codes like `AccessControl.InvalidRequest`, `AccessControl.NotFound`, `AccessControl.InternalError`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "35025473",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/35025473-59703d86-1ce5-4718-9ecd-c56670493bd8?source=collection_link"
  },
